  "bodyHash": "onuFgpq+Td8=",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"Serilum 模组。用心制作。大量适用于 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 的活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p><h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于该模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">矿石收割者允许玩家在蹲下时，通过破坏矿脉中的一个方块，瞬间挖掘整条矿脉。挖掘时间会随矿脉中矿石的数量而增加。所有矿石掉落物将集中在初始被破坏方块的位置。该模组兼容精准采集和其他附魔。只要与空气方块相邻，对角连接的方块也会被破坏。<br><br>该模组提供了多种配置选项来调整行为。还提供了一个黑名单文件，您可以在其中指定哪些镐子可以使用该模组的功能。<br><br>该模组开发时与我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">树木收割者</a> 模组兼容配合。</span></p><h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 QoL 合集\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>oreHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，则在不按住潜行键时进行矿石收割。若禁用则相反，仅当潜行时生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropOresAtFirstBrokenBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">是否将挖掘矿脉中的所有矿石掉落物集中在第一个被破坏方块的位置。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFuzzyOreSearch</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用模糊搜索时，使用方块的原始名称来判断是否为矿石方块。提高了与其他未设置方块标签的模组的兼容性，但会存在小概率的误判。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，每收割一个矿石，所持镐子会损失耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">可设置收割矿脉时镐子消耗的耐久度比例。例如设置为 0.1，则表示每收割 10 个矿石消耗 1 点耐久。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，玩家每收割一个矿石，疲劳值增加 0.005（Minecraft 默认每破坏一个方块的值）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">决定每收割一个矿石时玩家增加的疲劳值。默认值为 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若启用，挖掘时间会根据矿脉中现有矿石数量增加。增加量由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier' 决定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 0.2，最小值 0.01，最大值 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">当 'increaseHarvestingTimePerOre' 启用时，收割矿脉所需额外时间的比例。实际速度为：新速度 = 原速度 / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>镐子黑名单功能：</strong></span><br>可以仅允许特定镐子收割矿石矿脉。首次加载模组时会生成一个黑名单文件。它位于 <strong><em>./config/oreharvester/harvestable_pickaxe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能也适用于模组中添加的镐子物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"994\" height=\"622\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">挖掘矿脉中的任意矿石，所有相连方块均被破坏：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">兼容精准采集和其他附魔：</span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div><h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以在任何模组包中自由使用此模组，前提是下载链接仍保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 包含所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">评论区已禁用，因为无法在如此多的独立模组页面中跟踪评论。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他事项，请访问 <a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
